#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:1
#: 8b1aa900a42747eba2b5010080c5da19
msgid "从整体组成到数值分布"
msgstr "From overall composition to numerical distributions"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:3
#: a6278fd968a447c0906f5b37523e94e5
#
msgid ""
"拿到陌生训练集时，先回答两个问题：数据由哪些元素组合构成、关键物理量是否存在覆盖空缺或异常长尾。主工具栏中的 `训练集评估` "
"负责整体组成和证据概览，其中的「数据分布」标签页负责展开具体数值字段。"
msgstr "When opening an unfamiliar training set, first ask which element combinations it contains and whether important physical quantities have coverage gaps or abnormal tails. `Training Set Audit` in the main toolbar provides the overall composition and evidence overview, while its `Explore distributions` tab expands individual numerical fields."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:5
#: 48acaa8db9c142099da0955580cd3fd5
msgid "先看训练集整体"
msgstr "Start with the complete training set"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:7
#: 314fd8aaeb474166bf1fe72025d0ca5d
msgid ""
"加载数据后，点击主工具栏中的 "
"`训练集评估`。概览页会直接展示结构数、原子数、元素数和标签可用性，并用元素共现矩阵呈现训练集中一元、二元及多元组合的整体覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"After loading data, click `Training Set Audit` in the main toolbar. The "
"overview shows structure, atom, and element counts together with label "
"availability, and uses an element co-occurrence matrix to summarize "
"unary, binary, and multicomponent coverage."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: 46666590c0e94bafb4052a9a932eeb4f
msgid "训练集评估概览"
msgstr "Training set check overview"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:9
#: 46666590c0e94bafb4052a9a932eeb4f
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dataset_summary.png"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:14
#: ce405320af2a48c2b7969baef82cefe1
msgid "共现矩阵中的非对角单元格表示两个元素在同一结构中出现的频率；对角线表示单元素结构。点击一个元素后，左侧会聚焦显示与它相关的组合，便于查看它与哪些元素共同出现、哪些组合稀少或完全缺失。元素集合表保留精确的组合与占比，适合进一步核对。"
msgstr ""
"Off-diagonal matrix cells show how often two elements occur in the same "
"structure; diagonal cells represent single-element structures. Clicking "
"an element focuses the related combinations, making rare or missing "
"combinations easier to spot. The element-set table retains exact "
"combinations and shares for verification."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:16
#: 9554e5dc633b43718d588bb0f069196d
msgid "这个页面取代了旧的 `Dataset summary` 弹窗。整体统计、元素组合和后续证据现在都在同一处查看，不再需要从保存菜单进入独立摘要。"
msgstr ""
"This page replaces the former `Dataset summary` dialog. Overall "
"statistics, element combinations, and follow-up evidence now live in one "
"place instead of a separate summary under the Save menu."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:18
#: 9047e37690e24fafa5117eb071ebb5eb
msgid "再看力等关键字段"
msgstr "Inspect Forces and Other Key Fields"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:20
#: 216015dc269844bd861fa83698581669
#
msgid "在训练集评估中切到「数据地图 → 数据分布」，选择数据字段、统计范围和分组方式。本例查看 `force`，按元素分组，并用力的模长作横坐标："
msgstr "In Training Set Audit, switch to `Data map → Explore distributions` and choose a field, scope, and grouping mode. This example inspects `force`, groups by element, and uses force magnitude on the x-axis:"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:22
#: 3047b822e1d941cfb24e09e4ac4fec0d
msgid "按元素统计的原子力分布"
msgstr "Atomic-force distributions grouped by element"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:22
#: 3047b822e1d941cfb24e09e4ac4fec0d
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/force_distribution.png"

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:27
#: bf6feec272f04a73bd12ab7837b2c0ff
msgid "分布图可以比较不同元素或标签的覆盖范围，也可以切换参考值、预测值或误差，用同样方法检查能量、应力和磁力等字段。"
msgstr ""
"The distribution chart compares coverage across elements or labels. "
"Switch among reference, prediction, and error views to inspect energy, "
"stress, magnetic force, and other fields in the same way."

#: ../../source/example/dataset-summary-distributions.md:29
#: 53e063e390d6449891dcaab421345324
#
msgid ""
"概览负责发现“哪些组合存在或缺失”，数值分布负责发现“标签覆盖是否均衡”。发现孤立尖峰、异常长尾或某个组明显偏移后，点击对应分箱，把结构选回 "
"`NEP 数据集查看`，结合几何和原始计算结果复核。"
msgstr "The overview reveals which combinations exist or are missing; numerical distributions reveal whether label coverage is balanced. After finding isolated spikes, abnormal tails, or shifted groups, click the matching bin to send those structures back to `NEP Dataset Display`, then review them against their geometry and source calculations."

#~ msgid "一分钟看懂数据集组成和分布"
#~ msgstr "Understand Dataset Composition and Distributions in One Minute"

#~ msgid "先看总体组成"
#~ msgstr "Inspect the Overall Composition"

#~ msgid "数据集摘要窗口"
#~ msgstr "Dataset summary dialog"
